        },
        {
          "text": "bakeza kuli-Zerubabeli abapati banzubo, babaambila kuti, Atuyake anywe, nkaambo aswebo tulayandaula Leza wanu mbubonya mbuli ndinywe, pele tatuna kumutuulila zipaizyo kuzwa kumazuba aa-Esarihadoni mwami wa-Asuri iwakatusisya okuno. ",
          "type": "text",
