        {
          "text": "Mpawo Zerubabeli a-Jeshua abamwi bapati banzubo zya-Israyeli bakabaambila kuti, Tatujisi makani anywebo mukuyakila Leza wesu iŋanda. Tulayakila Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli tubeni, mbubonya mwami Koresi mwami wa-Persia mbwaakatulailila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
