          "text": "Lino olo lugwalo ilwakazwa kumwami Aritasasta, nilwakabalwa mumatwi­ aa-Rehumu a-Simisai mulembi abeenzinyina, bakafwambaana kuya ku­-Jerusalemu kuba-Juda, babasinikizya kuleka milimo. ",
